My draft keeps the agent’s duties inside A2 and A5 and makes each actor explicit. I’m revising “known” to cover source and type evidence, and “map content” to mean a whole module map, since focused answers legitimately contain links, definitions and locations. The remaining wording check is to ensure that stating a limit cannot excuse a missing link required by A2.
